  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is parallel to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>Substituting the values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;is perpendicular to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>, so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>From&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;we get&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><msub><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><msub><mover><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>(</mo><mn>9</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
